  "description": "Strong Cruising Ability - 20Ah Battery capacity with the torque transducer save more power for each ride.\n\nUpgrade with care - We replace the speed sensor with the upgrade torque sensors at higher prices.\n\nAnti-theft - Theft Protection GPS tracks your FD Ebike anytime and anywhere.\n\nEbike Inspection System helps you check each electric component and find the problem the first time.\n\nHandle all-terrain riding - With 26 x 4.0 fat tire, suitable for all kinds of roads, anti-fall in the rainy muddy road and snow.\n\nSafe 3A fast charge - It only takes 4 hours to recharge to 80%. The battery's BMS protection system is fully certified.\n\n750 Watt BAFANG motor - good quality brushless geared hub motor means good heat resistance and more energy saving.\n\nOil pressure disc brake system - Great braking system, faster and safer than machine braking. You can stop steadily at a second under high-speed emergency braking.\n\nIPX5-Waterproof Rate, handle every rainy day.\n\nLG Battery Cell - The same type of battery cell of new energy vehicles, stable and high performance with 20AH.\n\nHydraulic Suspension Fork, The light and stable front hydraulic suspension fork, coupled with shock-absorbing tires, is sensitive to every bump and is not afraid of bumpy roads\n\nLCD display easy to check all the riding details, battery power, riding mode, speed, and total mile.",
